graph TD
    A[Input image 224 x 224 x 3] --> B[Patchify into 16 x 16 patches]
    B --> C[196 patches on 14 x 14 grid]
    C --> D[Linear patch projection 768 to 384]
    D --> E[Patch tokens 196 x 384]
    E --> F[Add CLS token 197 x 384]
    F --> G[Add positional embedding]
    G --> H[Dropout]
    H --> I[Transformer block 1]
    I --> J[Transformer block 2]
    J --> K[Transformer block 3]
    K --> L[Blocks 4 through 11]
    L --> M[Transformer block 12]
    M --> N[Final LayerNorm]
    N --> O[Select CLS token]
    O --> P[Linear head 384 to 60]
    P --> Q[NICO++ class logits]
    Q --> R[Softmax probabilities]

    subgraph TBlock[Inside each transformer block]
        T0[Input tokens] --> T1[LayerNorm]
        T1 --> T2[Multi-head self-attention 6 heads]
        T2 --> T3[Attention projection]
        T3 --> T4[Residual add 1]
        T0 --> T4
        T4 --> T5[LayerNorm]
        T5 --> T6[MLP 384 to 1536]
        T6 --> T7[GELU and dropout]
        T7 --> T8[MLP 1536 to 384]
        T8 --> T9[Residual add 2]
        T4 --> T9
        T9 --> T10[Output tokens]
    end

    H -.-> X1[Token transformation]
    M -.-> X2[Raw attention and rollout]
    M -.-> X3[TAM attention plus gradients]
    C -.-> X4[Occlusion causal impact SHAP]
    P -.-> X5[Gradient x input]
